**5. Warehouse Staff Checklist:**

*   [ ] Immediately report any shipment delay exceeding 20% to the receiving supervisor.
*   [ ] Document the delay reason, shipment ID, and estimated delay duration in the WMS.
*   [ ] Assist in notifying the Inventory Manager and Vendor Account Manager.
*   [ ] Verify notification to the vendor and track their response.
*   [ ] Participate in the assessment of alternative sourcing options.
*   [ ] Document all alternative vendor evaluations.
*   [ ] Assist in securing a commitment from an alternative vendor.
*   [ ]  Accurately record all orders placed with alternative vendors in the WMS.
*   [ ]  Monitor current inventory levels and identify opportunities for reallocation.
*   [ ]  Reallocate inventory to impacted orders according to established prioritization guidelines.
*   [ ]  Document all inventory reallocations in the WMS.
*   [ ]  Communicate order adjustments to affected customers promptly and accurately.
*   [ ]  Maintain accurate records of all actions taken.

**6.  Review and Revision:** This SOP will be reviewed and revised annually, or as needed, to ensure its effectiveness and alignment with business requirements.

